  "body": "Hi,\nI have an intel mac with 15.3, and it does work here. I don't have an ARM machine to test on though, sorry.\nWhat you can try is to edit the file `$HOME/.config/ART/options`, setting `Verbose=2` and run from the terminal (i.e. `/Applications/ART.app/Contents/MacOS/ART`) to see if you get any useful output.\nIf the file doesn't exist, just create it with the following content:\n\n```text\n[General]\nVerbose=2\n```\n\nHTH",
